\n      width: 75px;\n      height: 43px;\n      overflow: visible;\n    }\n    .shape-item span {\n      display: block;\n      margin-top: 2px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      color: #908883;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 28px;\n      right: 48px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: #817a75;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"intro\">\n      还可以发现，斜钉一根木条的四边形木架的形状不会改变。这是因为斜钉一根木条后，四边形变成两个三角形。由于三角形有稳定性，斜钉一根木条的木架在未安装好之前也不会变形。<br>\n      三角形的稳定性有广泛的应用。图11.1-8表示其中一些例子。你能再举一些例子吗？\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"examples\" aria-label=\"图11.1-8\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder bridge\">[Photo: 钢架桥]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder crane\">[Illustration: 起重机]</div>\n      <div class=\"labels\">\n        <span class=\"bridge-label\">钢架桥</span>\n        <span class=\"crane-label\">起重机</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"figure-number\">图11.1-8</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"midline\">四边形的不稳定性也有广泛的应用。图11.1-9表示其中一些例子。</div>\n\n    <section class=\"examples-two\" aria-label=\"图11.1-9\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder scissor\">[Illustration: 活动拉架]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder gate\">[Photo: 伸缩门]</div>\n      <div class=\"labels-two\">\n        <span class=\"scissor-label\">活动拉架</span>\n        <span class=\"gate-label\">伸缩门</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"figure-number\">图11.1-9</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"exercise\">\n      <div class=\"badge\">练习</div>\n      <div class=\"question\">下列图形中哪些具有稳定性？</div>\n      <div class=\"shapes\">\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <div class=\"drawing\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 75 43\" aria-label=\"图形1\">\n              <path d=\"M4 35 L30 3 L71 4 L48 35 Z M30 3 L48 35\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d8987\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <span>（1）</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <div class=\"drawing\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 75 43\" aria-label=\"图形2\">\n              <rect x=\"7\" y=\"5\" width=\"60\" height=\"32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d8987\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n              <path d=\"M37 5 L37 37\" stroke=\"#8d8987\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <span>（2）</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <div class=\"drawing\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 75 43\" aria-label=\"图形3\">\n              <path d=\"M17 15 L37 3 L57 15 L57 38 L17 38 Z M17 15 L57 15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d8987\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <span>（3）</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <div class=\"drawing\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 75 43\" aria-label=\"图形4\">\n              <path d=\"M7 4 L64 14 L55 39 L21 39 Z M7 4 L40 22 M64 14 L40 22 M40 22 L55 39\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d8987\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <span>（4）</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <div class=\"drawing\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 75 43\" aria-label=\"图形5\">\n              <path d=\"M19 2 L52 7 L66 27 L49 41 L17 31 L4 19 Z M19 2 L49 41\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d8987\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <span>（5）</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <div class=\"drawing\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 75 43\" aria-label=\"图形6\">\n              <path d=\"M21 2 L55 9 L66 29 L47 42 L14 37 L4 19 Z M4 19 L55 9 M21 2 L47 42 M14 37 L55 9 M4 19 L47 42\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d8987\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <span>（6）</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">第十一章　三角形　　7</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
